---
import FullPage from '../layouts/FullPage.astro';
import { testimonials } from '../data/testimonials';

// Eight rendered at build time (no-JS fallback + indexable); the inline script below
// swaps in a random eight from the full pool on each load.
const initialTestimonials = testimonials.slice(0, 8);
---

<FullPage
  titleOverride="Novated Lease Guide — Independent Australian Calculator & Reference"
  description="Free independent Australian novated lease guide and calculator. Compare EV and ICE novated leases against cash purchase and car loan — based on real net outcomes, not misleading 'tax saved' figures."
>
  <div class="home-content">

    <!-- Two-column split: text left, calculator preview right -->
    <div class="home-hero-split">

      <!-- Left column -->
      <div class="home-hero-left">
        <div class="home-hero">
          <h1>Novated Lease Guide & Calculator</h1>
          <p class="home-hero-sub">Your <strong>true net cost</strong> — not the "tax saved" figure providers advertise.</p>

          <div class="home-cta-block">
            <div class="home-cta-row">
              <a href="/calculator/" class="home-cta-btn">Open the Calculator →</a>
              <a href="/tools/byo-employer-check/" class="home-cta-btn home-cta-btn--outline">Employer BYO Checker →</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="home-trust">Independent, ad-free, and no leads sold. <a href="https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-04-04/novated-leases-electric-vehicles-explainer/106527770" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Quoted by ABC News</a>. <a href="#testimonials">Recommended across the internet</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);margin:32px 0 28px;" />

        <div class="home-body">
          <p><strong>Many people dismiss EV novated leases for the wrong reasons</strong>, based on outdated rules of thumb rather than current rules.</p>
          <p><strong>Many people sign up for novated leases for the wrong reasons</strong>, based on misleading sales pitches rather than a clear understanding of costs, risks, and trade‑offs.</p>
          <p><strong>This site is written for both.</strong> The calculator is <a href="/start-here/calculator-comparison/">one of very few</a> that models true net savings — not the <a href="/costs-and-savings/false-saving-example/">misleading "tax saved" figure</a> most providers advertise. The accompanying articles cover the pros and cons in depth, written by someone with no affiliation with any leasing company and no financial interest in your decision.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-status">
          <span class="home-status__pill"><span class="home-status__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Up to date</span>
          <p class="home-status__text">Reflects the EV FBT wind-back, including the 25% FBT discount applying from April 2027 for eligible EVs above $75,000. <a href="/special-and-policy/ev-fbt-exemption-phase-out-budget-2026/">Read the explainer →</a></p>
        </div>
      </div><!-- /.home-hero-left -->

      <!-- Right column: two example calculator results (figures from the live engine, Simple-mode assumptions) -->
      <div class="home-calc-preview">
        <div class="home-calc-preview__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Example results">
          <button type="button" class="home-calc-preview__tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-panel="ev">EV · $110k salary</button>
          <button type="button" class="home-calc-preview__tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-panel="ice">Petrol · no offset</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Example 1: lease wins -->
        <div class="home-calc-preview__panel" data-panel="ev" role="tabpanel">
          <div class="home-calc-preview__header">
            <span class="home-calc-preview__badge">Example 1 of 2</span>
            <span class="home-calc-preview__label">Lease wins</span>
          </div>
          <div class="home-calc-preview__assumptions">EV, FBT-exempt · $65,000 drive-away · $110k salary · 5-year lease · 6.1% offset account</div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__title">Novated Lease vs Offset Cash</div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__saving">
            <div class="home-calc-preview__saving-amount">$28,477</div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__saving-desc">cheaper over 5 years</div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__rows">
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>NL lease payments</span><span>$60,433</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>NL residual payout</span><span>$18,420</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>NL electricity gain / loss</span><span>−$278</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row home-calc-preview__row--subtotal"><span>NL total</span><span>$78,575</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>Cash drive-away</span><span>$65,000</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>Cash running costs</span><span>$25,546</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row home-calc-preview__row--subtotal"><span>Offset Cash total</span><span>$90,546</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__divider"></div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__result-rows">
            <div class="home-calc-preview__result-row"><span>Cashflow advantage</span><span class="pos">+$11,971</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__result-row"><span>Home loan offset advantage</span><span class="pos">+$16,506</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__result-row home-calc-preview__result-row--total"><span>Total saving</span><span class="pos">$28,477</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Example 2: lease loses -->
        <div class="home-calc-preview__panel" data-panel="ice" role="tabpanel" hidden>
          <div class="home-calc-preview__header">
            <span class="home-calc-preview__badge">Example 2 of 2</span>
            <span class="home-calc-preview__label home-calc-preview__label--neg">Lease loses</span>
          </div>
          <div class="home-calc-preview__assumptions">Petrol, full FBT · $60,000 drive-away · $90k salary · 5-year lease · no offset account</div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__title">Novated Lease vs Cash</div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__saving home-calc-preview__saving--neg">
            <div class="home-calc-preview__saving-amount">$8,082</div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__saving-desc">more expensive over 5 years</div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__rows">
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>NL lease payments</span><span>$80,120</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>NL residual payout</span><span>$17,002</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row home-calc-preview__row--subtotal"><span>NL total</span><span>$97,122</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>Cash drive-away</span><span>$60,000</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row"><span>Cash running costs</span><span>$29,040</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__row home-calc-preview__row--subtotal"><span>Cash total</span><span>$89,040</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__divider"></div>

          <div class="home-calc-preview__result-rows">
            <div class="home-calc-preview__result-row"><span>Cashflow disadvantage</span><span class="neg">−$8,082</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__result-row"><span>Home loan offset advantage</span><span class="muted">$0 · no offset</span></div>
            <div class="home-calc-preview__result-row home-calc-preview__result-row--total"><span>Net extra cost</span><span class="neg">−$8,082</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="home-calc-preview__footer">
          Same calculator, two people: one saves $28,477, the other pays $8,082 more. <a href="/calculator/">Run your own figures →</a>
        </div>

        <script is:inline>
          (function () {
            var card = document.currentScript && document.currentScript.parentElement;
            if (!card) return;
            var tabs = card.querySelectorAll('.home-calc-preview__tab');
            var panels = card.querySelectorAll('.home-calc-preview__panel');
            tabs.forEach(function (tab) {
              tab.addEventListener('click', function () {
                var key = tab.getAttribute('data-panel');
                tabs.forEach(function (t) {
                  var on = t === tab;
                  t.classList.toggle('is-active', on);
                  t.setAttribute('aria-selected', on ? 'true' : 'false');
                });
                panels.forEach(function (p) { p.hidden = p.getAttribute('data-panel') !== key; });
              });
            });
          })();
        </script>
      </div><!-- /.home-calc-preview -->

    </div><!-- /.home-hero-split -->

    <!-- Grid cards -->
    <div class="home-grid-cards">
      <div class="home-card">
        <h3>🎓 New here?</h3>
        <p class="home-card__desc">Start with the fundamentals.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/start-here/what-is-novated-lease/">What is a novated lease — really?</a></li>
          <li><a href="/start-here/is-it-worth-it/">Is a novated lease right for me?</a></li>
          <li><a href="/start-here/ev-vs-ice-compared/">Why EV and ICE novated leases are different products</a></li>
          <li><a href="/costs-and-savings/why-tax-saved-is-wrong/">Why "tax saved" is the wrong way to evaluate a novated lease</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="home-card">
        <h3>🔍 Got a quote?</h3>
        <p class="home-card__desc">Cut through the numbers.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/calculator/">Open the calculator</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tools/byo-employer-check/">Employer BYO Checker — can you bring your own provider?</a></li>
          <li><a href="/start-here/use-nl-calculator/">How to use the novated lease calculator</a></li>
          <li><a href="/start-here/how-to-read-a-novated-lease-quote/">How to read a novated lease quote</a></li>
          <li><a href="/costs-and-savings/why-nl-interest-looks-high/">Why novated lease interest rates look high</a></li>
          <li><a href="/costs-and-savings/false-saving-example/">Real example: $21,320 "savings" → $5,591 net loss</a></li>
          <li><a href="/costs-and-savings/ev-nl-vs-keeping-petrol-car/">Real example: $81k Tesla cost-neutral to keeping a $25k Mazda</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="home-card">
        <h3>📖 Going deeper?</h3>
        <p class="home-card__desc">Browse the full guide by topic.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/start-here/what-is-novated-lease/">Fundamentals — core concepts</a></li>
          <li><a href="/costs-and-savings/">Mechanisms explained</a></li>
          <li><a href="/running-costs/">Running costs & claiming</a></li>
          <li><a href="/risks/">Risks & exit strategies</a></li>
          <li><a href="/special-and-policy/">Special cases & policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about/about-me/">About this guide</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Article browser -->
    <div class="article-browser" id="article-browser">
      <button class="article-browser__toggle" onclick="toggleBrowser()" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="browser-body">
        <span>Browse all articles by topic</span>
        <span class="article-browser__arrow" id="browser-arrow">▸</span>
      </button>
      <div class="article-browser__body" id="browser-body" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="article-browser__col">
          <div class="article-browser__col-title">Fundamentals</div>
          <div class="article-browser__group-title">Getting Started</div>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/start-here/what-is-novated-lease/">What is a novated lease — really?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/start-here/ev-vs-ice-compared/">Why EV and ICE novated leases are different products</a></li>
            <li><a href="/start-here/is-it-worth-it/">Is a novated lease right for me?</a></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="article-browser__group-title">Using the Tools</div>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/start-here/how-to-read-a-novated-lease-quote/">How to read a novated lease quote</a></li>
            <li><a href="/start-here/use-nl-calculator/">How to use the calculator</a></li>
            <li><a href="/start-here/calculator-comparison/">We reviewed 20 novated lease calculators</a></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="article-browser__group-title">Reference</div>
